{"id":"obstacle","lemma":"obstacle","pos":"noun","rank":3868,"glosses":["obstacle"],"ipa":"/ɔp.stakl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/65/Fr-obstacle.ogg/Fr-obstacle.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"obstacles"},"formAudio":{"obstacles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-obstacles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je ne vois pas d'obstacle.","en":"I don't see why not.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to see","l":"voir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Il a surmonté de nombreux obstacles.","en":"He has overcome many obstacles.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to overcome","l":"surmonter"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"numerous, many"},null]},{"text":"Il a rencontré un obstacle inattendu.","en":"He met an unexpected obstacle.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to meet","l":"rencontrer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"unexpected"}]},{"text":"Nous avons continué malgré les obstacles.","en":"We pushed ahead despite the obstacles.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to continue","l":"continuer"},{"g":"despite, in spite of"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null]},{"text":"Le mauvais temps n'est jamais un obstacle.","en":"Bad weather is no obstacle.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bad"},{"g":"time"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"never"},{"g":"a"},null]}]}